<!doctype html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=edge">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow">
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] - HUFLIT SHOP</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@4.6.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/5.15.4/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        :root {
            --color-dark: #121212;
            --color-muted: #666666;
            --color-border: #e2e8f0;
            --color-accent: #0f172a;
            --color-bg-light: #fafafa;
            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            --font-sans: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            font-family: var(--font-sans);
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
            color: var(--color-dark);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .auth-card {
            display: flex;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1080px;
            min-height: 680px;
            margin: 24px;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07);
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        }

        /* Banner trái */
        .auth-banner {
            flex: 1.1;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.88), rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.92)), 
                        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1490481651871-ab68de25d43d?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover no-repeat;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 60px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            position: relative;
        }

        .auth-banner__title {
            font-family: var(--font-serif);
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1.15;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .auth-banner__title em {
            font-style: italic;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        .auth-banner__desc {
            font-size: 0.98rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-top: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        .auth-banner__quote {
            border-left: 2px solid #cbd5e1;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        .auth-banner__quote p {
            font-family: var(--font-serif);
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-style: italic;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            color: #f1f5f9;
        }

        .auth-banner__quote span {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* Form bên phải */
        .auth-form-wrap {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 60px 55px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            background: #ffffff;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }

        .auth-mobile-logo {
            display: none;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .auth-mobile-logo img {
            height: 38px;
        }

        .auth-header__title {
            font-family: var(--font-serif);
            font-size: 2.4rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--color-dark);
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .auth-header__sub {
            color: var(--color-muted);
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        /* Input Controls */
        .auth-group {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .auth-group label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            color: #334155;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .auth-input {
            width: 100%;
            height: 48px;
            padding: 0 16px;
            border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--color-dark);
            background: var(--color-bg-light);
            transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out;
        }

        .auth-input:focus {
            outline: none;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-color: var(--color-accent);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
        }

        .auth-row-options {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
        }

        .auth-checkbox {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            color: #475569;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .auth-checkbox input {
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            accent-color: var(--color-accent);
        }

        .auth-forgot {
            color: var(--color-dark);
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .auth-forgot:hover {
            color: #2563eb;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        /* Buttons */
        .btn-luxury {
            width: 100%;
            height: 50px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            text-decoration: none !important;
        }

        .btn-luxury-dark {
            background: var(--color-accent);
            color: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.15);
        }

        .btn-luxury-dark:hover {
            background: #1e293b;
            color: #ffffff;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.2);
        }

        .btn-luxury-google {
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #1e293b;
            border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
            margin-top: 16px;
        }

        .btn-luxury-google:hover {
            background: var(--color-bg-light);
            border-color: #cbd5e1;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        /* Divider */
        .auth-separator {
            position: relative;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }

        .auth-separator::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--color-border);
        }

        .auth-separator span {
            position: relative;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 0 16px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .auth-footer-link {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 28px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #64748b;
        }

        .auth-footer-link a {
            color: var(--color-dark);
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 4px;
        }

        .auth-footer-link a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .auth-error-summary {
            background: #fef2f2;
            border: 1px solid #fecaca;
            color: #dc2626;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .auth-error-summary ul {
            margin: 0;
            padding-left: 18px;
        }

        @@media (max-width: 991px) {
            .auth-banner { display: none; }
            .auth-card { max-width: 480px; min-height: auto; border-radius: 16px; }
            .auth-form-wrap { padding: 40px 30px; }
            .auth-mobile-logo { display: block; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="auth-card">
        <div class="auth-banner">
            <div>
                <h2 class="auth-banner__title">Định Hình<br><em>Phong Cách Sống</em></h2>
                <p class="auth-banner__desc">
                    Trải nghiệm bộ sưu tập thời trang nữ thiết kế tinh tế, tỉ mỉ trong từng đường may. Cùng Huflit Shop tôn vinh vẻ đẹp riêng của bạn.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="auth-banner__quote">
                <p>"Style is a way to say who you are without having to speak."</p>
                <span>— Rachel Zoe</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="auth-form-wrap">
            <div class="auth-mobile-logo">
                <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">
                    <img src="/Client/img/logo-shop.png" alt="Huflit Shop">
                </a>
            </div>
            @RenderBody()
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>